  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Sleep Walk** (1 review): Listener appreciated the performance as a nod to Santo & Johnny [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Dark**: back after 25 archived shows (601 days) [7]\n- **Sooner**: back after 245 archived shows (6017 days) [7]\n- **Cobra Pt.2**: back after 213 archived shows (5389 days); rare: 4 archived performances [7]\n- **Cobra Pt.3**: back after 151 archived shows (3968 days); rare: 3 archived performances [7]\n- **Old Sept Blues**: back after 38 archived shows (1421 days); rare: 14 archived performances [7]\n- **Sleep Walk**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [7]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2023-06-30.mk41.flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 143 min; rated 4.8/5 by 5 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Microphone positioned inside SBD cage, slightly right of center, 24cm away [1]\n- Outdoor venue hosted the concert on a beautiful day [6]\n- Listeners later attended all three nights at the Beacon [6]\n- Reviewer called it one of the best ten MMJ shows they saw [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2023-06-30.mk41.flac24**: taped by chk; transferred by chk; source: Schoeps mk41> NBob actives> Naiant PFA> SD Mixpre-6 (FOB inside SBD cage slightly ROC, 24cm, 70deg) [1]",
